  (text "TIM-Bus (Apple II slot pinout).  A0-A7 only (A8-A15 left off to ease\nrouting; restore them if a card needs more).  -12 V, -5 V and +12 V\nare not supplied by this board.  7M, Q3, PHI1, COLORREF and USER1 not connected.\nDMA, INH and INTIN pulled up on the CPU sheet; this board does not\nimplement DMA or INH.  Slot address buffers belong on the backplane." (at 25.4 95.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a0da71be-5f8d-4ae3-8731-0f255090331e)
  )
